# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide shows how to use the Dice solver as an alternative SCI solver to diagonalize larger Fermionic problems beyond what the default PySCF solver can support. For information on how to install and use ``qiskit-addon-dice-solver``, [visit the documentation](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-dice-solver/). For more details on the SQD code used in this example, see the [chemistry Hamiltonian tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization).\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng gabay na ito kung paano gamitin ang Dice solver bilang alternatibong SCI solver para i-diagonalize ang mas malalaking Fermionic na problema na lampas sa kayang suportahan ng default na PySCF solver. Para sa impormasyon kung paano i-install at gamitin ang ``qiskit-addon-dice-solver``, [bisitahin ang dokumentasyon](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-dice-solver/). Para sa karagdagang detalye tungkol sa SQD code na ginamit sa halimbawang ito, tingnan ang [tutorial ng chemistry Hamiltonian](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization).\n"
